## Overview
Run spec <NNN>-<slug> through the SDD lifecycle of this project.

## Procedure
1. If `sdd/` exists in the repo, follow `sdd/workflow.yaml` step by step; at each step assume
   the agent role from `sdd/agents/<agent>.agent.md` (Mandatory Reading + Forbidden are binding).
2. If `sdd/` does NOT exist in the clone (stealth mode), ask the user to provide the spec,
   plan and task authorization inline before writing any code.
3. Checkpoint after every gate: post the gate name + verdict + evidence delta.
4. End only at evidence-complete + prepared gitflow. Partial work is reported partial.

## What's needed
Repo access · the spec id · explicit task authorization (no task list = no authorization).

